# Fix GoogleSignIn Constructor Error

The `google_sign_in` package version 7.2.0 appears to have removed or renamed the unnamed constructor, causing a compilation error in [google_auth.dart](file:///c:/projects/EvAnotes/mobile/lib/config/google_auth.dart).

## Proposed Changes

### Configuration

#### [MODIFY] [google_auth.dart](file:///c:/projects/EvAnotes/mobile/lib/config/google_auth.dart)
- Update the `googleSignInProvider` to use the correct constructor (likely `GoogleSignIn.standard` or `GoogleSignIn.instance`).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `flutter analyze` to ensure the compilation error is resolved.
- Run existing tests if applicable.

### Manual Verification
- Verify that Google Sign-In still works in the app (if an emulator is available).
